REPRODUCTION FROM THE EXTRACTED KIT
Large AI outputs, model/runtime binaries, intermediate tiles and review PNGs are delivered separately and excluded here. Install a compatible Linux/Python environment with NumPy and Pillow; several GB of RAM are required per inference process. Commands from the extracted kit directory:
python -m pip install --target inference/runtime --no-deps ncnn==1.0.20250916
curl -fL -o official_models_bundle.zip https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.2.5.0/realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan-20220424-ubuntu.zip
unzip official_models_bundle.zip 'models/realesrgan-x4plus-anime.*' -d inference
python inference/run_isolated.py "$PWD/native_floor.png" "$PWD/ai_upscale"
LANTERN_AI_RUNTIME="$PWD/inference" python inference/check_scene_seams.py "$PWD"
python inference/build_scene_review.py "$PWD"

run_isolated.py, run_test.py and check_scene_seams.py were restored from the prior delivered initiation-chamber kit. The review script is the restored script with only hero-reference path resolution adapted to support portable scene-relative paths; its original is included as recovered_original_build_scene_review.py. The exact extracted-kit installation flow was not separately retested. Matching source/settings tiles can resume; the source/config hash protects against cross-source tile reuse.

